sing your songs,

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.878
what does that mean to you?

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:36.395
Who is the hammiest out
of all of you guys?

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:40.966
-Um...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:45.504
-Okay, um...
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:47.940
-Okay, yeah.
-Easy, easy.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.443
-Alright, you guys swept
the MAMAs.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.979
You won Album, Icon, Song,
and Artist of the Year.

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:55.447
