-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:55.447 --> 00:01:57.383
-I was so excited.
-It was special.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.885
-That's crazy, right?
-Because of you.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.120
-What did your family think?

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:13.332
