-Mom, I love mom. I love mom.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:15.868
-Before BTS existed,
what did you want to be?

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.536
-Businessman.
-No.

00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:20.940
-Study hard and go into a --
you know, get a nice job.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.775
That's my dream.
[ Laughs ]

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.945
That was.
-V, what about you?

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:31.217
-Saxophonist.
-Saxophonist? Like here?

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.818
