what would you be?

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:56.242
-Tennis player.
-Tennis?

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:57.510
-Tennis player.
-Yeah.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.611
-Tennis?

00:02:58.611 --> 00:02:59.778
-Ha!
-Hyah!

00:02:59.778 --> 00:03:00.846
-Ha!
-Ho!

00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:02.382
-Ho!
-Oh!

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:03.549
-Yeah.

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:06.252
-He have bronze medal.
-Out of three teams.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.554
-Three teams. Three teams.
-He got bronze.

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:11.157
-Jin, how about you?
-I'm actor.

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:14.460
-You wanted to be an actor?
-Yeah.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.694
-No, no, you can't don't do
"Home Alone."

00:03:15.694 --> 00:03:18.197
Already did that.
Jungkook, how about you?

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:20.499
-My dream was pro gamer.
-Pro gamer.

00:03:20.499 --> 00:03:22.201
-Pro gamer.
-A gamer?

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:24.737
-Yeah.
-Jimin, what would you do?

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:27.807
Host a talk show?
-Oh, maybe.

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:29.742
-Don't take my job.
Don't take my job.

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:32.211
-Maybe Jimin Fallon.
-Oh!

00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:34.079
-Jimin Fallon.
-Jimin Fallon?

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:36.215
-Suga, if not for BTS,
what would you do?

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:39.218
-Producer or songwriter.
-Oh, really?

00:03:39.218 --> 00:03:41.154
First impressions -- what did
you think of each other

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:42.555
